-- src:921 | (a) endanger the safety, security or defence of Canada;
-- src:922 | (b) endanger the safety or security of the naval, army or air forces of any state other than Canada that are lawfully present in Canada; or
-- src:923 | (c) cause a serious risk to the health or safety of the public or any segment of the public.
